# Limit the subject line to 50 characters
# Capitalize the subject line
# Do not end the subject line with a period
# Use the imperative mood in the subject line
# Subject line starts with type (Add, Mod, Del)
# After type in parenthesies name the base bath of the change
# e.g. Add(model): math solver
# e.g. Mod(benchmarks): updated benchmarks for newest math solver model
# Separate subject line from body with a blank line

# Wrap the body at 72 characters
# Use the body to explain in detail
# What does it do and how is it used?
# Don't describe how it's done.
